[Term]
id: PREFER:0000061
name: oxygen uptake rate
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A respiratory metric variable that represents the rate at which oxygen is consumed by the cell culture from a bioreactor or fermentation system during the process." []
comment: Biorespiration. Dynamic respiratory metric
synonym: "o2 uptake rate" EXACT []
synonym: "OUR" EXACT OMO:0003012 []
is_a: PREFER:0000158 ! respiratory metric variable
relationship: BAO_0002874 uom:mmol.h-1 ! millimole per hour

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000062
name: carbon dioxide evolution rate
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A respiratory metric variable that represents the rate at which carbon dioxide is released by the cell culture in a bioreactor or fermentation system during the process." []
comment: Physical gas transfer. Dynamic respiratory metric
synonym: "CER" EXACT OMO:0003012 []
synonym: "co2 evolution rate" EXACT []
is_a: PREFER:0000158 ! respiratory metric variable
relationship: BAO_0002874 uom:mmol.h-1 ! millimole per hour

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000063
name: oxygen transfer rate
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A respiratory metric variable that represents the rate at which oxygen is transferred from the gas phase or fermenter air into the liquid phase within a bioreactor or fermentation system during the process." []
comment: Physical gas transfer. Dynamic respiratory metric
synonym: "OTR" EXACT OMO:0003012 []
is_a: PREFER:0000158 ! respiratory metric variable
relationship: BAO_0002874 uom:mol.h-1 ! mole per hour

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000064
name: carbon dioxide transfer rate
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A respiratory metric variable that represents the rate at which carbon dioxide is transferred out of the bioreactor or fermentation system during the process." []
comment: Important as carbon dioxide is considered a by-product in aerobic processes, and so is a parameter used for predicting biomass concentration, evaluating energetic efficiencies of growth, monitoring growth yields and controlling fed batch processes like airflow rates or stir speeds.
synonym: "CTR" EXACT OMO:0003012 []
is_a: PREFER:0000158 ! respiratory metric variable
relationship: BAO_0002874 uom:mol.h-1 ! mole per hour

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000065
name: respiratory quotient
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A respiratory metric variable that represent the ratio of carbon dioxide produced/formed to oxygen consumed during cellular metabolism in a bioreactor or fermentation system during the process, commmonly used to assess the metabolic state of cells." []
comment: Derived metabolic indicator.
synonym: "RQ" EXACT OMO:0003012 []
is_a: PREFER:0000158 ! respiratory metric variable
relationship: BAO_0002874 PREFER:7000007 ! dimensionless unit

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000068
