is_a: PREFER:9000001 ! process measurement variable
relationship: BAO_0002874 uom:g.h-1 ! gram per hour
relationship: PREFER:8000012 PREFER:0000150 ! has data acquisition quality data acquisition quality

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000077
name: dilution rate
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A feed process control variable that represents the target rate at which fresh feed medium is fed into a production culture relative to the total volume of the fermentation culture, representing the rate at which the production culture is diluted." []
synonym: "D" EXACT OMO:0003012 []
is_a: PREFER:0000009 ! feed process control variable
is_a: PREFER:0000015 ! operational parameter
relationship: BAO_0002874 uom:h-1 ! per hour (h⁻¹ or 1/h)

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000078
name: key process metric
def: "A process calculated variable that represents a set of quantitative metrics used to asses the efficiency or performance of the process impacting technoeconomic analysis." []
synonym: "key performance metric" EXACT []
is_a: PREFER:9000002 ! process calculated variable

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000079
name: carbon balance variable
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A carbon balance metric variable that represents the general carbon balance, which compares the total amount of carbon entering a bioreactor or fermenter system (through the substrate) to the total carbon leaving the system (through products, biomass or by-products)." []
synonym: "C balance" EXACT OMO:0003012 []
is_a: PREFER:0000157 ! carbon balance metric variable
relationship: BAO_0002874 PREFER:9000004 ! unit

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000081
name: degree of reduction balance variable
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A carbon balance metric variable that quantifies the redox state in a bioreactor or fermentar system during a process, by ensuring that the total electrons entering the system are equal to those leaving it, reflecting electron conservation." []
synonym: "DoR balance variable" EXACT OMO:0003012 []
is_a: PREFER:0000157 ! carbon balance metric variable
relationship: BAO_0002874 uom:%25 ! percent

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000083
name: compound consumed variable
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A compound balance metric variable that represents the total amount of compound consumed, substrate taken up by the cells, in a bioreactor or fermentation system, during the process." []
is_a: PREFER:0000162 ! compound balance metric variable
relationship: BAO_0002874 PREFER:9000004 ! unit

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000085
name: microbioreactor scale
def: "A laboratory bioreactor scale that refers to very small volume bioreactor systems designed for high-throughput screening, typically operated at working volumes in the range of approximately a few microliters." []
comment: For instance, microtiter plates (MTPs) fall within this category.
is_a: PREFER:0000186 ! laboratory bioreactor scale

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000086
name: minibioreactor scale
def: "A laboratory bioreactor scale that refers to small volume bioreactor systems designed for parallelized process development and experimentation, typically operated at working volumes in the range of approximately 10 milliliters to a few liters." []
comment: For instance, Ambr250 or Pioreactors fall within this category.
is_a: PREFER:0000186 ! laboratory bioreactor scale

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000087
name: substrate uptake rate
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A bioproduction metric variable that represents the rate at which substrate is taken up by the cells, in a bioreactor or fermentation system during the process." []
synonym: "QS" EXACT OMO:0003012 []
is_a: PREFER:0000159 ! bioproduction metric variable
relationship: BAO_0002874 PREFER:9000004 ! unit

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000088
name: batch phase
def: "A fermentation phase that is a time interval of a batch fermentation process." []
is_a: PREFER:0000016 ! fermentation phase

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000089
name: specific substrate uptake rate
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A bioproduction metric variable that represents the rate of substrate uptake per unit of biomass, in a bioreactor or fermentation system during the process." []
is_a: PREFER:0000159 ! bioproduction metric variable
relationship: BAO_0002874 PREFER:9000004 ! unit

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000090
name: feed phase
def: "A fermentation phase that is a time interval within a fermentation process, where feed medium injection is observed." []
is_a: PREFER:0000016 ! fermentation phase

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000091
name: process titer metric
def: "A key process metric that represents a quantitative metric of the final concentration of the product or biomass in the process." []
is_a: PREFER:0000078 ! key process metric

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000094
name: substrate yield (biomass) variable
