def: "A process yield metric variable that represents the yield of a compound consumed (substrate) per biomass (X), quantifying how efficiently substrate compound is consumed relative to biomass produced in a bioreactor or fermentation system, during the process." []
synonym: "substrate yield (X) variable" EXACT []
is_a: PREFER:0000155 ! process yield metric
relationship: BAO_0002874 PREFER:9000004 ! unit

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000095
name: growth phase
def: "A fermentation phase that is a time interval within a fermentation process, where culture growth is observed." []
is_a: PREFER:0000016 ! fermentation phase

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000096
name: production phase
def: "A fermentation phase that is a time interval within a fermentation process, where product formation is observed." []
is_a: PREFER:0000016 ! fermentation phase

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000101
name: oxygen production rate
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A bioproduction metric variable that represents the rate of oxygen consumed over time, in a bioreactor or fermentation system during the process." []
synonym: "o2 Q" EXACT OMO:0003012 []
synonym: "Oxygen volumetric rate" EXACT []
is_a: PREFER:0000159 ! bioproduction metric variable
relationship: BAO_0002874 PREFER:9000004 ! unit

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000103
name: specific oxygen uptake rate
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A process measurement variable that indicates the specific rate at which oxygen is consumed in a bioreactor or fermentation system during a process, normalized per unit of biomass (X), reflecting how efficiently oxygen is consumed in relation to biomass production." []
synonym: "specific OUR" EXACT []
is_a: PREFER:9000001 ! process measurement variable
relationship: BAO_0002874 PREFER:7000001 ! mole per carbon mole per hour

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000104
